ASKING

If you want to do something this licence does not allow — including building
something on top of it — ask. The answer is often yes and always cheaper than
guessing: hello@html2wp.dev

Non-profits, schools and open source projects: write and say what you are
doing — a complimentary licence is usually available. That is a decision the
Licensor makes, not a reading of "Commercial Use": a non-profit can carry on
economic activity and be caught by that definition like anyone else, so do
not assume it, just ask.
